      "decision": "Redesign: \"one day at the café\". Scroll-linked sky (dawn blush, morning butter, noon sky, afternoon apricot, golden coral, dusk indigo) with sun orange for actions and aubergine ink; Bricolage Grotesque; soft shapes (arch-topped photos, pills). Replaces the roast direction."
